3.4 Ethnic Population
3.4.1 Household Characteristics: The total ethnic household of Rangamati zila, as enumerated in
Population and Housing Census 2011, are 77353 which cover 60.20% of the total household of the
zila with an average size of household 4.59 persons. It is observed that 2.20% and 31.16% of the
ethnic household avail the opportunity of tap and tube-well water for drinking respectively. Moreover,
27.83% and 31.37% have access to sanitary latrine and electricity connection respectively.
3.4.2 Population Characteristics: The total ethnic population of the zila is 356153 persons of
which 181820 are male and 174333 are female. Among the total population of the zila, only 59.76%
constitute the ethnic population with a sex ratio of 104. The literacy rate (7 years and above) of the
ethnic population for both sex, male and female are 53.32%, 51.35% and 34.97% respectively

